    "sections": [
      {
        "body": "The saved run asks A: whether a mature departure returns to checkpoint-frozen VWAP within thirty minutes; B: whether frozen VWAP return occurs before a half-sigma extension; C: which of frozen day and session VWAP is reached first after a session failure. ES, NQ and GC remain separate.",
        "id": "question",
        "kind": "text",
        "title": "Question and scope"
      },
      {
        "body": "Checkpoint rates depend on the selected population. Return-first and extension-first compete with neither and same-bar ambiguous outcomes. Destination events retain both day-first and session-first outcomes. Added geometry improves context prediction only modestly and without an executable strategy claim.",
        "id": "findings",
        "kind": "text",
        "title": "Supported findings"
      },
